WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.150
Ryu extends crouching medium kick outside Luke’s range.

2
00:00:01.150 --> 00:00:01.700
Forward heavy punch catches the low’s recovery as Punish Counter.

3
00:00:01.700 --> 00:00:02.500
The second heavy-punch target hit connects.

4
00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:03.650
Perfect medium Flash Knuckle links after the target follow-up.

5
00:00:03.650 --> 00:00:04.800
Perfect light Flash Knuckle continues the conversion.

6
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.900
Heavy Flash Knuckle completes the whiff punish.
